<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1887755980"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:13.678"><div begin="13.537" end="37.430" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.537" end="19.475" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.537" end="15.285">我只是不愿意</span><span begin="15.285" end="15.875">再</span> <span begin="16.050" end="17.114">字斟句酌</span><span begin="17.114" end="18.199">躲在时光</span><span begin="18.199" end="18.780">里沉</span><span begin="18.780" end="19.475">默</span></p><p begin="19.855" end="24.543" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.855" end="20.756">并非不</span><span begin="20.756" end="21.337">信</span><span begin="21.337" end="21.617">因</span><span begin="21.617" end="22.085">果</span> <span begin="22.378" end="22.919">便</span><span begin="22.919" end="23.208">要</span><span begin="23.208" end="23.509">执</span><span begin="23.509" end="24.543">着</span></p><p begin="26.220" end="32.135" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.220" end="27.877">有些结局早已</span><span begin="27.877" end="28.454">在</span> <span begin="28.708" end="29.469">千年中</span><span begin="29.469" end="30.283">斑驳被</span><span begin="30.283" end="30.825">后</span><span begin="30.825" end="31.448">世描</span><span begin="31.448" end="32.135">摹</span></p><p begin="32.275" end="37.430" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.275" end="32.687">与</span><span begin="32.687" end="33.247">其</span><span begin="33.247" end="33.979">郁郁</span><span begin="33.979" end="34.280">而</span><span begin="34.280" end="34.830">终</span> <span begin="35.049" end="35.847">不如一</span><span begin="35.847" end="37.430">搏</span></p></div><div begin="37.740" end="1:05.870" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="37.740" end="44.016" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.740" end="38.237">世</span><span begin="38.237" end="38.788">间</span><span begin="38.788" end="39.110">的</span><span begin="39.110" end="39.489">苦</span><span begin="39.489" end="40.523">涩</span> <span begin="41.031" end="41.380">只</span